        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86167, 8 Inch Palermo Lost Wax Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Lost Wax Bronze 8 Inch Palermo Column Door Pull is traditionally styled, making it an instant classic. The barrel middle door handle is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. The 8 Inch Palermo Lost Wax Door Handle is available in either flat black or medium bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/tuscany-palermo-back-to-back-door-handle-pair-emtek-btb-86167\"><b>Palermo Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Tuscany Palermo Lost Wax Cast Bronze Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Lost Wax Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-lost-wax-finish.jpg?v=1704354555\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
